{"seq":3,"slug":"intermolecular-forces","title":"分子间作用力（Intermolecular Forces）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/general-chemistry/chemical-bonding/intermolecular-forces","wordCount":2931,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"分子间作用力-intermolecular-forces\">分子间作用力（Intermolecular Forces）</h1><h2 id=\"引言\">引言</h2><p>化学键（离子键、共价键、金属键）是原子间的强相互作用，决定了分子的内部结构。而分子间作用力（intermolecular forces, IMF）是分子与分子之间相对较弱的相互作用，决定了物质的宏观物理性质——沸点、熔点、蒸气压、粘度、表面张力、溶解度等。</p>\n<p>理解分子间作用力是解释&quot;为什么水在 100°C 才沸腾而甲烷在 -161°C 就已是气体&quot;的关键。本文系统介绍四种主要的分子间作用力：London 色散力、偶极-偶极相互作用、氢键和离子-偶极作用，分析它们的物理起源、强度和对物质性质的影响。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>分子间作用力（IMF）是<strong>分子之间相对较弱的相互作用</strong>，与分子内部的化学键相对。它的强度远低于化学键（通常弱一到两个数量级），却决定了物质的沸点、熔点、粘度、表面张力、溶解度等宏观物理性质。四种主要作用力按物理起源分类：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>London 色散力</strong>：瞬时偶极诱导邻近分子的偶极，存在于<strong>所有</strong>分子之间</li>\n<li><strong>偶极-偶极作用</strong>：永久偶极间的取向吸引</li>\n<li><strong>氢键</strong>：X-H···Y（X、Y 为 F/O/N）的强定向作用，兼具静电与部分共价特征</li>\n<li><strong>离子-偶极作用</strong>：离子与极性分子间的静电吸引（溶液中溶解与溶剂化的核心）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>关键判据：色散力、偶极力、诱导力都随距离按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^{-6}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 衰减；<strong>离子-偶极作用按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^{-2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 衰减</strong>，因此数量级更强（50–200 kJ/mol）。</p>\n<p><strong>边界与常见误解</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>氢键的供体是<strong>与 H 相连的高电负性原子 X</strong>，H 本身不是供体；没有 X-H 键就没有氢键</li>\n<li>&quot;分子量越大沸点越高&quot;只在同类分子比较时成立；分子极性、氢键与分子形状（接触面积）常使排序反转（如 H₂O vs H₂S）</li>\n<li>氢键不是化学键，但强度接近其下限（10–40 kJ/mol），不能简单归入&quot;微弱作用力&quot;</li>\n<li>色散力不是&quot;次要修正&quot;——对非极性大分子，它往往是主要的分子间吸引力</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[分子间作用力 IMF] --&gt; B[van der Waals 力 r^-6]&#10;    A --&gt; C[氢键 X-H···Y]&#10;    A --&gt; D[离子-偶极 r^-2]&#10;    B --&gt; E[London 色散力 所有分子]&#10;    B --&gt; F[偶极-偶极 极性分子]&#10;    B --&gt; G[偶极-诱导偶极]&#10;    C --&gt; H[水的异常性质]&#10;    D --&gt; I[盐的溶解与水合]&#10;    E --&gt; J[沸点 粘度 表面张力]&#10;    F --&gt; J&#10;    C --&gt; J\">graph TD\n    A[分子间作用力 IMF] --&gt; B[van der Waals 力 r^-6]\n    A --&gt; C[氢键 X-H···Y]\n    A --&gt; D[离子-偶极 r^-2]\n    B --&gt; E[London 色散力 所有分子]\n    B --&gt; F[偶极-偶极 极性分子]\n    B --&gt; G[偶极-诱导偶极]\n    C --&gt; H[水的异常性质]\n    D --&gt; I[盐的溶解与水合]\n    E --&gt; J[沸点 粘度 表面张力]\n    F --&gt; J\n    C --&gt; J</pre><h2 id=\"van-der-waals-力\">van der Waals 力</h2><p>van der Waals 力是分子间作用力的总称，包括 London 色散力、偶极-偶极力和偶极-诱导偶极力。这三种力的共同特征是：源于电荷分布的不均匀性，强度远弱于化学键，且都随距离增大而迅速减弱（与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^{-6}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 成正比）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"london-色散力-分散力\">London 色散力（分散力）</h3><p><strong>物理起源</strong>：即使在非极性分子中，电子的瞬时分布也不是完美对称的——在任何给定时刻，电子云可能偏向分子的一侧，产生<strong>瞬时偶极矩</strong>。这个瞬时偶极会诱导邻近分子产生相应的偶极（诱导偶极），两者之间的吸引力即为 London 色散力。</p>\n<p>Fritz London 于 1930 年从量子力学角度给出了色散力的能量表达式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>disp</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>I</mi></mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>6</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\text{disp}} \\approx -\\frac{3}{4} \\frac{\\alpha^2 I}{r^6}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">disp</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1771em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 为分子的极化率（polarizability），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 为电离能，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 为分子间距离。</p>\n<p><strong>影响色散力强度的因素</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>极化率</strong>：分子越大（电子越多、电子云越扩散），极化率越高，色散力越强</li>\n<li><strong>分子形状</strong>：长形分子的接触面积大，色散力比球形分子更强。例如正戊烷（bp 36°C）vs 新戊烷（bp 9.5°C），两者分子量相同</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>色散力的普遍性</strong>：色散力存在于所有分子之间（包括极性分子和非极性分子），是唯一适用于所有物质的分子间作用力。对于大分子和非极性分子，色散力是主要的分子间吸引力。</p>\n<p><strong>数据示例</strong>——稀有气体沸点随原子序数递增（色散力增强）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>元素</th>\n<th>电子数</th>\n<th>沸点 (K)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>He</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>4.2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ne</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>27.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ar</td>\n<td>18</td>\n<td>87.3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kr</td>\n<td>36</td>\n<td>119.8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Xe</td>\n<td>54</td>\n<td>165.0</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"偶极-偶极相互作用\">偶极-偶极相互作用</h3><p><strong>物理起源</strong>：极性分子具有永久偶极矩。当极性分子相互接近时，它们倾向于正负端相对排列（反平行取向），产生净吸引力。</p>\n<p><strong>能量表达式</strong>（Keesom 力）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>dip-dip</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mi>μ</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><msub><mi>ε</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mi>T</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\text{dip-dip}} = -\\frac{2\\mu_1^2 \\mu_2^2}{3(4\\pi\\varepsilon_0)^2 k_B T \\cdot r^6}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dip-dip</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4271em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4519em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2481em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4519em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2481em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu_1, \\mu_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为两分子的偶极矩，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 为温度。注意该力随温度升高而减弱（热运动破坏有序取向）。</p>\n<p><strong>强度</strong>：通常为 5–25 kJ/mol，介于色散力和氢键之间。</p>\n<p><strong>影响因素</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>偶极矩越大，偶极-偶极作用越强</li>\n<li>分子越小（距离越近），作用越强</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>实例对比</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分子</th>\n<th>分子量</th>\n<th>偶极矩 (D)</th>\n<th>沸点 (°C)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>N₂</td>\n<td>28</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>-196</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CO</td>\n<td>28</td>\n<td>0.11</td>\n<td>-192</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HCl</td>\n<td>36.5</td>\n<td>1.08</td>\n<td>-85</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HF</td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>1.82</td>\n<td>19.5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>HCl 的沸点（-85°C）远高于同等分子量的非极性气体（如 Ar，-186°C），额外的偶极-偶极作用是主要原因。</p>\n<h3 id=\"偶极-诱导偶极相互作用-debye-力\">偶极-诱导偶极相互作用（Debye 力）</h3><p><strong>物理起源</strong>：极性分子的永久偶极会使邻近的非极性分子（或极性分子）产生诱导偶极。两者之间的吸引力称为 Debye 力。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>ind</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msubsup><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><msub><mi>ε</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\text{ind}} = -\\frac{\\alpha_2 \\mu_1^2}{(4\\pi\\varepsilon_0)^2 r^6}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ind</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4271em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4519em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2481em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>强度</strong>：通常最弱（1–5 kJ/mol），在大多数体系中可忽略。但在某些特殊情况下（如 I₂ 溶于极性溶剂）具有重要意义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"氢键\">氢键</h2><h3 id=\"定义与特征\">定义与特征</h3><p>氢键（hydrogen bond）是一种特殊的、较强的分子间作用力，发生在 <strong>X-H···Y</strong> 体系中，其中 X 和 Y 是电负性高且原子半径小的原子（主要是 F、O、N）。</p>\n<p><strong>形成条件</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>质子供体</strong>（donor）：X-H 中 X 为高电负性原子，使 H 带有显著正电荷</li>\n<li><strong>质子受体</strong>（acceptor）：Y 具有孤对电子，可与缺电子的 H 形成定向作用</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>氢键的特殊性</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>H 原子极小（无内层电子），当与高电负性原子键合后几乎裸露出正电荷</li>\n<li>具有方向性（X-H···Y 接近线性，约 180°）</li>\n<li>强度为 10–40 kJ/mol，远强于普通 van der Waals 力，但弱于共价键</li>\n<li>部分具有共价特征（电荷转移）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"氢键强度的变化\">氢键强度的变化</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>氢键类型</th>\n<th>典型强度 (kJ/mol)</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>F-H···F</td>\n<td>约 155（最强）</td>\n<td>HF₂⁻</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>O-H···O</td>\n<td>10–30</td>\n<td>H₂O, 醇, 羧酸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>O-H···N</td>\n<td>15–25</td>\n<td>蛋白质-水</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>N-H···O</td>\n<td>8–20</td>\n<td>蛋白质, 核酸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>N-H···N</td>\n<td>5–15</td>\n<td>核酸碱基对</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"氢键对性质的影响\">氢键对性质的影响</h3><p><strong>沸点异常</strong>：氢族元素（第 16、17 族）氢化物的沸点本应随分子量增大而递增，但 H₂O 和 HF 的沸点远高于趋势线预测值：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分子</th>\n<th>分子量</th>\n<th>沸点 (°C)</th>\n<th>预期沸点 (°C)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>H₂O</td>\n<td>18</td>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>约 -80</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>H₂S</td>\n<td>34</td>\n<td>-60</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HF</td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>19.5</td>\n<td>约 -90</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HCl</td>\n<td>36.5</td>\n<td>-85</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>H₂O 如果没有氢键，在室温下应该是气体——地球上不可能有液态水，生命也无法存在。</p>\n<p><strong>水的特殊性质</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>高比热容：大量能量用于破坏氢键，调节气候</li>\n<li>高汽化热：蒸发散热效率高</li>\n<li>固态密度低于液态（冰浮于水）：氢键网络在冰中形成开放的四面体结构</li>\n<li>高表面张力：分子间氢键网络的凝聚力</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"生物体系中的氢键\">生物体系中的氢键</h3><p>氢键在生物大分子中起着决定性的结构作用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>蛋白质</strong>：α-螺旋和β-折叠的二级结构通过主链 N-H···O=C 氢键维持</li>\n<li><strong>DNA</strong>：互补碱基对通过氢键配对（A-T 2 个氢键，G-C 3 个氢键），维持双螺旋结构</li>\n<li><strong>酶-底物识别</strong>：氢键参与分子识别的特异性</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"离子-偶极作用\">离子-偶极作用</h2><h3 id=\"定义\">定义</h3><p>离子-偶极作用（ion-dipole interaction）是离子与极性分子之间的静电吸引力。虽然严格来说不属于&quot;分子间&quot;作用力（涉及离子），但在溶液化学中极为重要。</p>\n<p><strong>能量表达式</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>ion-dip</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><msub><mi>ε</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\text{ion-dip}} = -\\frac{|z| \\cdot e \\cdot \\mu \\cdot \\cos\\theta}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0 \\cdot r^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ion-dip</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.263em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 为离子电荷，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 为溶剂分子偶极矩，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 为偶极与离子-溶剂方向的夹角，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 为离子-溶剂分子中心的距离。</p>\n<h3 id=\"强度与距离依赖\">强度与距离依赖</h3><p>离子-偶极作用与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^{-2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 成正比（而非 van der Waals 力的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^{-6}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），因此强度高得多（50–200 kJ/mol），衰减也更慢。</p>\n<h3 id=\"在溶解过程中的作用\">在溶解过程中的作用</h3><p>离子化合物溶于水的驱动力就是离子-偶极作用。水分子以氧端朝向阳离子（δ⁻ 端朝正电荷）、以氢端朝向阴离子（δ⁺ 端朝负电荷），形成水合壳层。</p>\n<p><strong>溶解的能量平衡</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>溶解</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>U</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>水合</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta H_{\\text{溶解}} \\approx -U + \\Delta H_{\\text{水合}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">溶解</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">水合</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只有当水合能（离子-偶极作用的总和）能补偿晶格能的&quot;损失&quot;时，溶解才是热力学有利的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"各种分子间作用力的比较\">各种分子间作用力的比较</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>作用力类型</th>\n<th>典型强度 (kJ/mol)</th>\n<th>距离依赖</th>\n<th>适用对象</th>\n<th>方向性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>离子-偶极</td>\n<td>50–200</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^{-2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>离子 + 极性分子</td>\n<td>有</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>氢键</td>\n<td>10–40</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>X-H···Y (F,O,N)</td>\n<td>有（线性）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>偶极-偶极</td>\n<td>5–25</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^{-6}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>极性分子间</td>\n<td>有（取向）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>偶极-诱导偶极</td>\n<td>1–5</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^{-6}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>极性 + 可极化分子</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>London 色散力</td>\n<td>0.05–40</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^{-6}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>所有分子</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对比化学键：共价键 150–1100 kJ/mol，离子键 600–4000 kJ/mol（晶格能）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分子间作用力与物质性质\">分子间作用力与物质性质</h2><h3 id=\"沸点\">沸点</h3><p>沸点反映了液态分子克服分子间作用力进入气相所需的能量。分子间作用力越强，沸点越高。</p>\n<p><strong>影响沸点的因素</strong>（按重要性排序）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>是否存在氢键（若有，大幅升高）</li>\n<li>分子极性（偶极-偶极作用）</li>\n<li>分子量/极化率（色散力）</li>\n<li>分子形状（接触面积）</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"粘度与表面张力\">粘度与表面张力</h3><p><strong>粘度</strong>：液体流动的阻力。分子间作用力越强，分子移动需要克服的阻力越大，粘度越高。甘油（3 个 OH，多重氢键）的粘度是水的千倍以上。</p>\n<p><strong>表面张力</strong>：液体表面分子受到向内的净引力（内部分子周围各方向作用力对称，表面分子只有一侧有邻居），形成&quot;收缩&quot;的趋势。水因氢键网络而具有较高的表面张力（72.8 mN/m, 20°C）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"溶解度\">溶解度</h3><p>&quot;相似相溶&quot;（like dissolves like）的经验规则本质上是分子间作用力的匹配：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>极性溶质溶于极性溶剂（离子-偶极、偶极-偶极作用替代原有作用力）</li>\n<li>非极性溶质溶于非极性溶剂（色散力替代色散力，无能量罚分）</li>\n<li>非极性溶质不溶于极性溶剂（无法补偿溶剂分子间氢键/偶极力的损失）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"要点总结\">要点总结</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>作用力</th>\n<th>物理起源</th>\n<th>关键影响因素</th>\n<th>典型现象</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>London 色散力</td>\n<td>瞬时偶极-诱导偶极</td>\n<td>极化率、分子大小/形状</td>\n<td>稀有气体沸点趋势</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>偶极-偶极力</td>\n<td>永久偶极排列</td>\n<td>偶极矩大小</td>\n<td>极性分子沸点升高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>氢键</td>\n<td>X-H···Y（F/O/N）</td>\n<td>X/Y 电负性、孤对电子</td>\n<td>水的异常性质</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>离子-偶极力</td>\n<td>离子与极性分子</td>\n<td>离子电荷、溶剂偶极矩</td>\n<td>盐的溶解</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>分子间作用力虽然比化学键弱得多（通常弱一到两个数量级），却决定了物质在宏观尺度上的大部分物理行为。从水的生命友好性到蛋白质的折叠，从药物与受体的结合到材料的力学性能——分子间作用力是化学连接微观结构与宏观世界的核心纽带。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分子间作用力（Intermolecular Forces）","id":"分子间作用力-intermolecular-forces"},{"level":2,"text":"引言","id":"引言"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"van der Waals 力","id":"van-der-waals-力"},{"level":3,"text":"London 色散力（分散力）","id":"london-色散力-分散力"},{"level":3,"text":"偶极-偶极相互作用","id":"偶极-偶极相互作用"},{"level":3,"text":"偶极-诱导偶极相互作用（Debye 力）","id":"偶极-诱导偶极相互作用-debye-力"},{"level":2,"text":"氢键","id":"氢键"},{"level":3,"text":"定义与特征","id":"定义与特征"},{"level":3,"text":"氢键强度的变化","id":"氢键强度的变化"},{"level":3,"text":"氢键对性质的影响","id":"氢键对性质的影响"},{"level":3,"text":"生物体系中的氢键","id":"生物体系中的氢键"},{"level":2,"text":"离子-偶极作用","id":"离子-偶极作用"},{"level":3,"text":"定义","id":"定义"},{"level":3,"text":"强度与距离依赖","id":"强度与距离依赖"},{"level":3,"text":"在溶解过程中的作用","id":"在溶解过程中的作用"},{"level":2,"text":"各种分子间作用力的比较","id":"各种分子间作用力的比较"},{"level":2,"text":"分子间作用力与物质性质","id":"分子间作用力与物质性质"},{"level":3,"text":"沸点","id":"沸点"},{"level":3,"text":"粘度与表面张力","id":"粘度与表面张力"},{"level":3,"text":"溶解度","id":"溶解度"},{"level":2,"text":"要点总结","id":"要点总结"}],"prev":{"title":"分子几何与 VSEPR（Molecular Geometry and VSEPR）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/general-chemistry/chemical-bonding/molecular-geometry"},"next":{"title":"化学计量与平衡（Stoichiometry and Chemical Equilibrium）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/general-chemistry/chemical-reactions/stoichiometry-equilibrium"}}